{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01965","headline":"杂曲歌辞 昔昔盐 今岁往辽西 · 赵嘏","name":"杂曲歌辞 昔昔盐 今岁往辽西","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"万里飞书至，闻君已渡辽。\n祗谙新别苦，忘却旧时娇。\n烽戍年将老，红颜日向雕。\n胡沙兼汉苑，相望几迢迢。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"赵嘏","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_01965.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01965","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}